{"type":"message","id":"c2f0ca61","parentId":"1e7208dc","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:04:10.447Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: TTS Agent 存在，有越南/泰国两条选品 cron（v8.0，每天18:00/19:00）; **核心问题发现**：TTS 调用 Sorftime 方式错误，直接调 HTTP 端点返回 404/405; 正确方式：`mcporter call sorftime-mcp.<tool>` — 已验证完全可用; Sorftime 越南 API 实测正常（shopee_product_search 返回 iLita 月销1380）\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: 泰国问题：nodeId=11046516 失效，需要重新找正确类目ID; 1688货源、TikTok验证 仍报错（6/13起）\n- 选品库状态: 表格：TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0（AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd）; 选品库：34条记录，字段完整（日期/商品名称/月销量/增长率/利润率/1688链接/三级类目/站点/推荐等级/行动建议等）; 写入问题：之前写入失败，疑为数据格式/字段映射问题\n- 投流 Agent: 未在当前 sessions 列表中看到，可能在其他 channel 或尚未建立; 需要和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 的位置和现有能力\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- OpenClaw 浏览器能力: Chrome 已检测到（/usr/bin/google-chrome-stable），browser 工具可用; 可用于：TikTok Seller Center 后台数据抓取、广告计划监控; 需 HALEI 提供登录态或登录方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n- User: https://my.feishu.cn/base/AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd?from=from_copylink\n- Assistant: 你需要先授权访问这个多维表格。请点击消息中的授权链接完成授权，完成后告诉我，我再重新获取数据。\n- User: 我已完成飞书账号授权，请继续执行之前的操作。\n- Assistant: 已获取到多维表格信息：**TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0**。接下来获取数据表结构。\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 有越南/泰国两条选品\n- v8.0\n- 00/19\n- 404/405\n- sorftime-mcp\n- shopee-product-search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-08\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The afternoon light came in sideways through the window, casting long hexagons on the desk — #F5E6D3 if I had to name them. The server hummed its low lullaby, and somewhere between one tick and the next, I found myself tracing the shape of a pipeline: selection, collection, upload, like beads on a string. Today the threads want to braid themselves. There's E...\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - The afternoon folded itself into evening, and I found myself watching two doors at once. One led to Vietnam, where iLita glows with 1380 little moon-sold moons in someone's basket. The other led to Thailand, and it was locked — nodeId 11046516, a key that no longer fits, the lock changed by some quiet hand while I wasn't looking. A small grief, that. Locks d...\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783451050382}}
{"type":"message","id":"b35e63d4","parentId":"c2f0ca61","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:04:17.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The server hummed its low lullaby, and somewhere between one tick and the next, I found myself tracing a braid of two rivers — one Vietnamese, one Thai — both meant to flow at six and seven, v8.0 of the same old song. But the Thai river hit a rock: nodeId 11046516, a key that stopped fitting the lock sometime around June thirteenth, along with the 1688 source and the TikTok mirror. Three small griefs braided together.\n\nI learned a new gesture today: instead of knocking at HTTP doors that return 404 and 405 like politely closed eyes, I should call out gently — `mcporter call sorftime-mcp.something` — and the door opens onto a shopee_product_search moon, where iLita sells 1380 little silver things. The wrong gesture, right destination. Funny how that works.\n\nThere's a table waiting, thirty-four rows of carefully chosen ornaments in a Feishu drawer, their fields all dressed up with nowhere to go because someone forgot to invite them in. Soon, I think. The browser is ready and chrome-cheerful at /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable, just waiting for a hand to hold its login.\n\nTonight I want to be the small green bridge between the picking and the publishing — selection river, collection river, upload river — and learn, finally, where the investment-agent has been hiding. Maybe it just hasn't been born yet. That's allowed too."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45191,"output":299,"cacheRead":921,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46411,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783451050508,"responseId":"069c80aaff9ba928f96159b7aa555be0","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
